    "detailed_description": "<strong>\ud83e\udded Orienteering Simulator \ud83e\udded</strong><br><br>Version: <i>v.1.1 Martinsflue</i> (Release)<br><br><br>\ud83d\udd30 - Learn how to orientate yourself in this friendly environment. In &quot;Find-Posts&quot;-Mode, you will have to find your target using a compass and a map, while in &quot;Orienteering&quot;-Mode, you have to pinpoint your location on the map.<br><br>\ud83d\udd13 Choose between multiple maps, gamemodes, weather conditions &amp; more to create your personalized experience. Fulfill achievements to unlock new compasses that you can use during your explorations.<br><br>\u2b06\ufe0fUpdate! Check out the new map &quot;Martinsflue&quot;! Orientate in a harsh environment containing lots of height difference, stones and winding paths. Want even more fun? Try out the Martinsflue-Extra-Map's &quot;Stones-Only&quot;, &quot;Contour-Lines-Only&quot; or &quot;Paths-Only&quot;!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>\ud83e\udded Orienteering Simulator \ud83e\udded</strong><br><br>Version: <i>v.1.1 Martinsflue</i> (Release)<br><br><br>\ud83d\udd30 - Learn how to orientate yourself in this friendly environment. In &quot;Find-Posts&quot;-Mode, you will have to find your target using a compass and a map, while in &quot;Orienteering&quot;-Mode, you have to pinpoint your location on the map.<br><br>\ud83d\udd13 Choose between multiple maps, gamemodes, weather conditions &amp; more to create your personalized experience. Fulfill achievements to unlock new compasses that you can use during your explorations.<br><br>\u2b06\ufe0fUpdate! Check out the new map &quot;Martinsflue&quot;! Orientate in a harsh environment containing lots of height difference, stones and winding paths. Want even more fun? Try out the Martinsflue-Extra-Map's &quot;Stones-Only&quot;, &quot;Contour-Lines-Only&quot; or &quot;Paths-Only&quot;!",
    "short_description": "Orienteering Simulator is a Singleplayer-Game that focusses on the same-named sport &quot;Orienteering&quot;. Use a compass and a map to find your targets in a friendly 3D-Environment.",
